    "text": "<p>The number of moles of&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>Co</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi>Br</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>02</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>02</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></math>&nbsp;</p><p>The number of moles of&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>Co</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msub><mi>Br</mi></mrow></mfenced><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>02</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>02</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></math></p><p>The total volume of the solution becomes two Litres after mixing.</p><p>Following precipitation reactions occur:<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Co</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi>Br</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>+</mo></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>AgNO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8594;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>AgBr</mi><mo>&#8595;</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mi>mol</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>excess</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Co</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msub><mi>Br</mi></mrow></mfenced><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><mo>+</mo></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>BaCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8594;</mo></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>BaSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#8595;</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mi>mol</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>excess</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p>",
